    "text": "By Noah Schuessler ,\n1 days ago With the recent announcement that students at Springfield will be given access to Gemini and Gemini Notebook, it had me thinking: Why is promoting artificial intelligence a positive thing? Education in the United States has felt like it’s been in a tornado the last few years, and the integration of artificial intelligence into the classroom won’t change that. Read full article",
